OL,3,GNEWSADeath bloom on the horizon for
OL,4,Agiant agave
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare death bloom has begun at Kew
OL,7,FGardens for a three-metre plant, which
OL,8,Fwill come to the end of its life with a
OL,9,Fspectacular display.
OL,11,FThe Agave montana plant, native to the
OL,12,Fmountainous habitats of north-eastern
OL,13,FMexico, has been growing on average
OL,14,Fabout 10cm (4 in) a day at the west
OL,15,FLondon attraction.
OL,17,FThe mountain agave, which was planted
OL,18,Faround 20 years ago, will open up into
OL,19,Fa massive cluster of thousands of
OL,20,Findividual flowers when it blooms.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
